          "snippet": {
            "line": 168,
            "text": "  -- A loop `γ` at `x` lies in `S`, and `τ x` is a loop inside `U (i₀ x)`, so `γ` lies in `H`.\n  refine eq_top_iff.2 fun γ _ ↦ ?_\n  have hγ : γ.asHom ∈ S.arrows (mk x) (mk x) := by\n    rw [hS]\n    trivial\n  have hτx : (End.of (τ (mk x)) : _root_.FundamentalGroup X x) ∈ H :=\n    fromPath_mem_iSup_range hx _ (hτ' x)\n  have h := H.mul_mem hτx (H.mul_mem hγ (H.inv_mem hτx))\n  rw [hinv] at h\n  convert h using 1\n  ext\n  simp"
          }
        }
